{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/CollectParams.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.mkGrindOnlyTactics\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkGrindOnlyTactics</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cfg</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.TSyntax\">TSyntax</a> <span class=\"fn\">`Lean.Parser.Tactic.optConfig</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">seq</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.TGrind\">TGrind</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">extraParams</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/CollectParams.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.TParam\">TParam</a></span> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List.toArray\">#[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List.toArray\">]</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ematchLimit</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> (<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.TSyntax\">TSyntax</a> <span class=\"fn\">`tactic</span>))</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Given a `grind` tactic sequence, extracts parameters and builds a `grind only` tactics.\nIt returns at most two. The first tactic uses anchors to restrict the search if applicable.\nThe second does not restrict the search using anchors. The second option is included only if there\nare anchors.\n\nThe `extraParams` are additional parameters (e.g., term arguments from the original `grind?` call)\nthat should always be included in the suggestion.\n\nIf `seq` performs more than `ematchLimit` E-matching rounds between case-splits, the suggestions\nset the `ematch` limit to that number. The search that produced `seq` may have performed more\nrounds because case-splits reset the round counter, even if they were pruned from `seq`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/CollectParams.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.mkGrindOnlyTactics","kind":"def","line":157,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.mkGrindOnlyTactics","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/CollectParams.lean#L157-L192"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/CollectParams.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.mkFinishTactic\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkFinishTactic</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">seq</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.TGrind\">TGrind</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">extraParams</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/CollectParams.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.TParam\">TParam</a></span> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List.toArray\">#[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List.toArray\">]</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.TGrind\">TGrind</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Given a `grind` tactic sequence, extracts parameters and builds a terminal `finish only` tactic.\nThe `extraParams` are additional parameters (e.g., from the original `finish?` call) that\nshould always be included.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/CollectParams.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.mkFinishTactic","kind":"def","line":148,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.mkFinishTactic","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/CollectParams.lean#L148-L155"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/CollectParams.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.TParam\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">TParam</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/CollectParams.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.TParam","kind":"def","line":19,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.TParam","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/CollectParams.lean#L19-L19"}}],"imports":["Init.Syntax","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Types"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.CollectParams"}